    {
     "t": "event-field",
     "field": "datetime",
     "text": "September 5, 2026\n@ 3:30 pm\n- September 6, 2026\n@ 10:00 pm"
    },
    {
     "t": "image",
     "ref": "assets/source/35261ab5-Outer-Cape-Music-Festival-200px-x-200px.png",
     "srcUrl": "https://b2702268.assetcdn.net/2.0/2702268/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Outer-Cape-Music-Festival-200px-x-200px.png?lossy=2&strip=0&webp=1",
     "alt": "Outer Cape Music Festival - Labor Day Weekend, Sept. 5th & 6th 2026 at the Wellfleet Pier. Cape Cod Cannabis is a proud sponsor!",
     "w": 200,
     "h": 200,
     "kind": "event-image"
    },
    {
     "t": "rich",
     "html": "<p>Stop in at Cape Cod Cannabis <em>(a proud sponsor)</em>, <a href=\"/directions/\">located on Rt. 6 in the South Wellfleet shopping plaza</a>, before the event and experience the largest selection of quality products at the best prices on Cape Cod! Please consume responsibly and have a great time at the Outer Cape Music Festival 2026!</p>"
    },
    {
     "t": "heading",
     "level": 4,
     "text": "Organizer Update:"
    },
    {
     "t": "rich",
     "html": "<p>We’re sad to announce that, due to recently implemented immigration requirements affecting their travel,<br> The Baha Men will unfortunately be unable to join us at this year’s Outer Cape Music Festival.</p><p><img src=\"assets/source/d5b5f4ba-outer-cape-music-festival-updated-768x1024.png\" alt=\"Outer Cape Music Festival - Labor Day Weekend, Sept. 5th &amp; 6th 2026 at the Wellfleet Pier. Cape Cod Cannabis is a proud sponsor!\" width=\"768\" height=\"1024\" title=\"Cape Cod Cannabis Recreational Dispensary in Wellfleet, MA\" data-source-url=\"https://b2702268.assetcdn.net/2.0/2702268/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/outer-cape-music-festival-updated-768x1024.png?lossy=2&amp;strip=0&amp;webp=1\" data-master=\"assets/source/e4cde6aa-outer-cape-music-festival-updated.png\"></p><p><strong>Buy your tickets today and for more information visit @ <a href=\"https://www.outercapemusicfest.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Outer Cape Music Festival 2026</a>!</strong></p>"
    },
